  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.25 Course medical director",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.25 “Course medical director” means a physician with emergency medical experience who acts as the ultimate medical authority regarding training program content, procedures, and protocols at any of the division approved levels.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
